              "symbol": "ExactArgs",
              "role": "definition"
            },
            {
              "file": "flag_groups.go",
              "symbol": "Command.ValidateFlagGroups",
              "role": "definition"
            }
          ],
          "note": "### Argument and flag rules reject invalid input\n\nAn app can choose a positional argument check such as `ExactArgs`. Flag group rules can require a set or reject conflicting flags before the handler runs.",
          "editor": {
            "primary": "args.go"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "t4",
          "view": "view:overview",
          "focus": [
            "file:completions.go"
          ],
          "code": [
            {
              "file": "completions.go",
              "symbol": "Command.initCompleteCmd",
              "span": {
                "from": 1,
                "to": 12
              },
              "role": "usage"
            }
          ],
          "note": "### Completion requests use a hidden command\n\nCobra creates a hidden command for shell completion. Its handler calls `getCompletions` to produce candidates for the shell.",
          "editor": {
            "primary": "completions.go"
          }
        },
